WEBVTT

00:04.520 --> 00:06.650
<b>Secret Sword: Tobi-Izuna!</b>

00:10.730 --> 00:14.950
<b>For better or for worse,
because it grazed Kenshin's right arm,</b>

00:14.950 --> 00:18.740
<b>the force was dampened enough
to not sever the arm.</b>

00:19.240 --> 00:23.120
<b>However, that boy will not be able
to perform swordsmanship ever again.</b>

00:24.420 --> 00:25.750
<b>That can't be.</b>

00:29.960 --> 00:32.090
<b>You've got to be kidding me.</b>

00:32.420 --> 00:36.050
<b>He's betting his life on swordsmanship!
And he has talent!</b>

00:36.300 --> 00:38.760
<b>So why do things end up this way?</b>

00:39.010 --> 00:42.470
<b>You're a doctor, right?
Then do something about it! Hey!</b>

00:43.520 --> 00:45.810
<b>Impossible things are simply impossible.</b>

00:48.360 --> 00:49.940
<b>I'm sorry, Yahiko.</b>

00:50.520 --> 00:53.900
<b>It really is a shame,
but doctors are not omnipotent.</b>

02:32.000 --> 02:36.010
<b>EPISODE 17:
SETTLING THE SCORE</b>

02:36.760 --> 02:37.720
<b>Are you okay?</b>

02:38.420 --> 02:39.510
<b>Yuta.</b>

02:40.340 --> 02:41.970
<b>My right hand doesn't move...</b>

02:43.100 --> 02:44.680
<b>so it really isn't a dream.</b>

02:46.850 --> 02:48.020
<b>So my mentor...</b>

02:49.270 --> 02:50.520
<b>betrayed me.</b>

02:54.770 --> 02:56.820
<b>Himura went on his way.</b>

02:59.860 --> 03:00.910
<b>We're heading out, too!</b>

03:02.280 --> 03:03.120
<b>Huh?</b>

03:03.370 --> 03:05.080
<b>You shouldn't move around yet.</b>

03:05.280 --> 03:07.200
<b>You need to take it easy.</b>

03:07.200 --> 03:09.910
<b>No way.
You have to see them settling the score.</b>

03:10.410 --> 03:12.250
<b>If you don't witness it
with your own eyes,</b>

03:12.250 --> 03:13.880
<b>you won't be able to stand up anymore.</b>

03:18.550 --> 03:20.800
<b>Really, those guys are hopeless.</b>

03:21.260 --> 03:24.680
<b>Keep a good eye on them
so that they don't do anything reckless.</b>

03:25.180 --> 03:26.010
<b>Okay.</b>

03:32.100 --> 03:33.230
<b>So late.</b>

03:33.940 --> 03:36.320
<b>It is long past two hours already.</b>

03:37.150 --> 03:41.150
<b>That man feared my secret sword
and ran away.</b>

03:41.650 --> 03:42.740
<b>Are you dumb?</b>

03:43.610 --> 03:47.240
<b>What reason does he have
to run away from you?</b>

03:48.200 --> 03:52.710
<b>Oh, sorry. I just threw a wet blanket
on your excuse to turn tail.</b>

03:52.920 --> 03:54.960
<b>I won't stop you, so you can head off.</b>

03:54.960 --> 03:57.170
<b>Can't help it if you're facin' Kenshin.</b>

03:58.630 --> 04:01.920
<b>It's for your own good
if you run away while you can.</b>

04:02.510 --> 04:04.680
<b>Watch your mouth, young one.</b>

04:05.180 --> 04:08.930
<b>I don't mind toying with you to kill time.</b>

04:09.390 --> 04:12.640
<b>I don't mind, either, but is it okay?</b>

04:13.140 --> 04:15.020
<b>Losing against a swordsman
might still fly,</b>

04:15.480 --> 04:19.860
<b>but if you lose against
a fighter for hire, it's all over for you.</b>

04:30.700 --> 04:32.710
<b>Neither you or I got any luck.</b>

04:32.910 --> 04:35.710
<b>You were wishy-washy, so he came back.</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:39.840
<b>Here's our headliner now.</b>

04:42.510 --> 04:45.130
<b>I will have you seriously fight me
this time around!</b>

04:45.470 --> 04:49.760
<b>I will defeat you
and build a new era of my Shinko-ryu!</b>

04:53.600 --> 04:55.980
<b>That technique called Izuna</b>

04:55.980 --> 05:00.230
<b>is actually a wave of vacuum
created by dislocation of air.</b>

05:00.730 --> 05:03.530
<b>A natural phenomenon
often called a Wind Scythe.</b>

05:03.740 --> 05:05.950
<b>Oh, you noticed.</b>

05:06.320 --> 05:09.330
<b>The wound is open,
but there is little bleeding.</b>

05:09.330 --> 05:12.330
<b>That is indeed characteristic
of injuries suffered from Wind Scythes.</b>

05:12.660 --> 05:16.040
<b>Even if you figured out what it is,
the power of Izuna doesn't change!</b>

05:18.040 --> 05:23.260
<b>How the blade tip warps for an instant
is the same as shimmering in the summer,</b>

05:23.670 --> 05:27.130
<b>which results from the instantly
created difference in air density.</b>

05:29.510 --> 05:31.510
<b>The trick to seeing it was there.</b>

05:32.010 --> 05:35.270
<b>But it was my error
that I could not do so.</b>

05:35.270 --> 05:36.440
<b>Then, at the least,</b>

05:37.060 --> 05:39.020
<b>I can knock Izuna down!</b>

05:39.270 --> 05:40.310
<b>Shut up!</b>

05:41.730 --> 05:43.480
<b>Only third-tier guys get hit twice</b>

05:43.480 --> 05:45.950
<b>or even thrice by an attack
they've seen once.</b>

05:46.280 --> 05:48.740
<b>Kenshin would never
make a blunder like that.</b>

05:49.740 --> 05:53.240
<b>Since Secret Sword: Tobi-Izuna
has an amazing sharpness,</b>

05:53.240 --> 05:54.830
<b>he can't block the blow.</b>

05:55.330 --> 05:58.920
<b>But for the super-elite that can
even see bullets fired from pistols,</b>

05:58.920 --> 06:00.580
<b>it's not impossible to dodge it.</b>

06:01.590 --> 06:03.670
<b>Then, what about this?</b>

06:05.420 --> 06:06.840
<b>A flurry of Tobi-Izuna!</b>

06:20.190 --> 06:23.150
<b>You see that? This is Izuna!</b>

06:23.150 --> 06:26.490
<b>My secret sword that I found
in a book of ancient arts</b>

06:26.490 --> 06:28.610
<b>and spent 10 years to master!</b>

06:28.820 --> 06:31.490
<b>It's not something that is beaten easily!</b>

06:31.490 --> 06:37.450
<b>This is the symbol of Shinko-ryu
and the ultimate murderous sword!</b>

06:38.000 --> 06:39.080
<b>Are you happy?</b>

06:41.380 --> 06:42.250
<b>Huh?</b>

06:43.090 --> 06:47.590
<b>You seem so elated
just from giving me one little scratch.</b>

06:48.420 --> 06:50.130
<b>What was that?</b>

06:51.140 --> 06:53.890
<b>I'm sure of something now, Raijuta.</b>

06:54.390 --> 06:57.140
<b>Sure of what?</b>

06:57.850 --> 07:00.480
<b>You claim to practice a murderous sword...</b>

07:01.520 --> 07:04.360
<b>but you've never killed a man.</b>

07:05.820 --> 07:09.780
<b>A true manslayer
who has killed someone in the past</b>

07:09.780 --> 07:13.780
<b>wouldn't be so shamelessly proud
of his sword that didn't kill its target.</b>

07:15.160 --> 07:20.540
<b>You don't know how deep
the abyss of a manslayer's sword is.</b>

07:20.750 --> 07:27.340
<b>And your thoughtless and prideful blade
robbed swordsmanship from Yutaro.</b>

07:29.590 --> 07:32.470
<b>Prepare for compensation
that fits what you did!</b>

07:35.010 --> 07:36.680
<b>I will not take such repeated insults!</b>

07:36.680 --> 07:37.850
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

07:44.520 --> 07:47.480
<b><i>I see. You had that tactic left.</i></b>

07:47.730 --> 07:50.400
<b>A combination attack
of Matoi-Izuna and Tobi-Izuna!</b>

07:52.110 --> 07:56.080
<b><i>You use Matoi-Izuna while within reach,
not allowing a chance to attack.</i></b>

07:56.280 --> 07:59.540
<b><i>Then once out of range, you aim
for a lethal wound with Tobi-Izuna.</i></b>

07:59.750 --> 08:02.460
<b><i>Since you can't counterattack
or stop Izuna,</i></b>

08:02.460 --> 08:04.630
<b><i>the only thing left to do
is keep dodging.</i></b>

08:04.920 --> 08:07.130
<b><i>On top of that, his right arm is wounded.</i></b>

08:07.500 --> 08:11.170
<b><i>With just his left arm, the effectiveness
of Ryuutsuisen is halved.</i></b>

08:11.420 --> 08:14.260
<b><i>And most of all, he can't make use
of his prized battojutsu.</i></b>

08:14.590 --> 08:17.390
<b>He might be in trouble if this
remains one-sided attrition.</b>

08:17.680 --> 08:19.430
<b>I see it! It's there!</b>

08:20.640 --> 08:21.600
<b>Kenshin!</b>

08:22.560 --> 08:24.190
<b>Game over!</b>

08:24.690 --> 08:26.560
<b>No matter how fast you are,</b>

08:26.560 --> 08:29.280
<b>you can't move freely
with your leg injured.</b>

08:29.940 --> 08:33.490
<b>I told you, don't get so giddy
each time you graze me with an attack.</b>

08:33.490 --> 08:39.450
<b>Shut it. Even if I show off,
you can't counterattack at this distance.</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:44.170
<b>Though, it's a different story
if you could use Tobi-Izuna like I can.</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:48.000
<b>Tobi-Izuna... that's something I can't do.</b>

08:48.210 --> 08:52.210
<b>Indeed so. Shinko-ryu is supreme.</b>

08:52.210 --> 08:54.550
<b>Izuna is the most powerful.</b>

08:55.220 --> 08:56.050
<b>Die!</b>

08:56.260 --> 09:00.010
<b>However, attacks from out of range
is something I can do as well!</b>

09:06.310 --> 09:08.520
<b>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu Battojutsu!</b>

09:09.230 --> 09:10.520
<b>Hiryuusen!</b>

09:10.650 --> 09:11.860
<b>Wha—</b>

09:31.050 --> 09:34.050
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

09:52.690 --> 09:53.530
<b>Kenshin!</b>

10:01.120 --> 10:02.620
<b>Fr-Freeze!</b>

10:03.160 --> 10:05.500
<b>If you move, I'll kill this brat!</b>

10:08.210 --> 10:10.840
<b>I told you, I'll kill this brat!</b>

10:10.840 --> 10:12.840
<b>L-Let go of that sword!</b>

10:13.340 --> 10:14.760
<b>Go ahead and do it.</b>

10:15.550 --> 10:17.550
<b>Go ahead and do it, if you even can!</b>

10:17.930 --> 10:21.300
<b>Even if I die,
I'd never submit to someone like you!</b>

10:22.850 --> 10:25.020
<b>The kid himself is telling you to do it.</b>

10:25.520 --> 10:26.890
<b>Go ahead and try.</b>

10:27.480 --> 10:30.190
<b>Shinko-ryu is a murderous sword, isn't it?</b>

10:33.110 --> 10:35.610
<b>A real sword, an ancient art...</b>

10:35.610 --> 10:38.990
<b>such things do not determine whether or
not a sword is murderous, that they don't.</b>

10:39.450 --> 10:43.490
<b>A sword that plummets you into the abyss
with the weight of the souls you took...</b>

10:43.990 --> 10:45.700
<b>that is a murderous sword.</b>

10:46.790 --> 10:49.710
<b>You have never killed a soul.</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:54.880
<b>Your Shinko-ryu may be able to slash men,
but it cannot kill them.</b>

10:56.300 --> 10:57.670
<b>Abandon your sword...</b>

10:58.170 --> 11:02.550
<b>before you come across a real
murderous sword and lose your life.</b>

11:30.410 --> 11:31.250
<b>Let's go.</b>

11:34.210 --> 11:35.340
<b>Shall we?</b>

11:46.970 --> 11:49.520
<b>Farewell... sir.</b>

12:05.490 --> 12:09.950
<b>I'm terribly sorry, but the young master
says he doesn't want to see anyone.</b>

12:10.410 --> 12:11.790
<b>I see.</b>

12:12.330 --> 12:14.040
<b>Oh, this is a sympathy gift.</b>

12:14.040 --> 12:15.540
<b>Why, thank you.</b>

12:16.250 --> 12:18.880
<b>We'll visit again soon.</b>

12:19.340 --> 12:21.050
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

12:22.260 --> 12:24.050
<b>I'd like to ask as much of you, too.</b>

12:26.930 --> 12:29.180
<b>It's no wonder he's all cooped up now.</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:32.270
<b>He was betrayed by the mentor
he thought was the ideal guy,</b>

12:32.600 --> 12:35.980
<b>and on top of that, he was told he'd
never be able to do swordsmanship again.</b>

12:36.440 --> 12:38.940
<b>Kamiya Kasshin-ryu is a life-giving sword,</b>

12:39.440 --> 12:41.940
<b>but what should I be doing
in times like this?</b>

12:41.940 --> 12:43.570
<b>I'm so powerless.</b>

12:43.570 --> 12:45.950
<b>I can't even think
of one phrase of consolation.</b>

13:08.550 --> 13:10.430
<b>Come to think of it...</b>

13:10.890 --> 13:14.100
<b>when our lives quickly changed
after the Meiji Revolution,</b>

13:14.440 --> 13:17.650
<b>as a lowly samurai with no connections,</b>

13:17.650 --> 13:22.570
<b>I relied only on my skills of sword
appraisal to become a sword merchant.</b>

13:22.780 --> 13:25.910
<b>That turned out to be a huge hit
with foreign customers,</b>

13:25.910 --> 13:28.490
<b>and I grew to create my current fortune.</b>

13:29.490 --> 13:32.910
<b>While many samurai
met their downfall as of late,</b>

13:32.910 --> 13:36.500
<b>my life is a success
from an outsider's view.</b>

13:37.000 --> 13:39.380
<b>However, upon changing
how you look at things,</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:41.500
<b>you could say that it is a loser's life.</b>

13:41.880 --> 13:45.760
<b>Though this was in order to raise
my family and to protect my home,</b>

13:46.260 --> 13:49.600
<b>I curried favors
to those that we once called barbarians</b>

13:49.600 --> 13:52.810
<b>and sold off swords,
the souls of samurai.</b>

13:53.720 --> 13:59.690
<b>That must be why Yutaro wanted to live
a life different from mine...</b>

14:00.360 --> 14:02.230
<b>in my place.</b>

14:03.480 --> 14:09.450
<b>However, he was deceived by the
superficial strength of Raijuta Isurugi.</b>

14:12.330 --> 14:13.410
<b>Oh, there you are.</b>

14:14.290 --> 14:15.700
<b>That was quick, that you were.</b>

14:16.540 --> 14:21.040
<b>Mr. Yuzaemon, it seems our visit is done,
so if you will excuse me...</b>

14:21.540 --> 14:23.050
<b>See you again soon.</b>

14:23.500 --> 14:25.630
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

14:25.630 --> 14:28.880
<b>But the next time we meet
will likely be the last.</b>

14:29.840 --> 14:32.300
<b>I've been thinking about my options,</b>

14:32.300 --> 14:37.730
<b>and I decided to move to Germany,
taking Yutaro with me.</b>

14:37.730 --> 14:39.060
<b>Germany?</b>

14:40.060 --> 14:44.610
<b>Germany is the most medically advanced
country in the world right now.</b>

14:44.610 --> 14:49.740
<b>If we concentrate on treatment there,
I thought that perhaps...</b>

14:49.740 --> 14:52.410
<b>That, and by living abroad,</b>

14:52.410 --> 14:56.500
<b>Yutaro may be able to completely
forget about swordsmanship.</b>

14:57.620 --> 15:00.120
<b>We will be leaving in one week.</b>

15:00.120 --> 15:03.090
<b>I have no idea
when we will return to Japan.</b>

15:07.630 --> 15:11.090
<b>SHIMBASHI STATION</b>

15:14.260 --> 15:17.520
<b>I really thank you very much
for everything you have done.</b>

15:17.890 --> 15:20.940
<b>Now, Yutaro, go give your farewells.</b>

15:24.570 --> 15:25.610
<b><i>Yuta...</i></b>

15:27.190 --> 15:30.910
<b><i>I really can't think
of even one word to comfort you.</i></b>

15:31.360 --> 15:36.370
<b><i>Cheering you up, like, "Do your best,"
ain't gonna be any consolation.</i></b>

15:40.160 --> 15:42.920
<b>Milord, it's almost time.</b>

15:42.920 --> 15:44.460
<b>Oh, all right.</b>

15:45.040 --> 15:46.250
<b>Then...</b>

16:00.560 --> 16:01.480
<b>Yutaro!</b>

16:07.270 --> 16:08.650
<b>Yahiko?</b>

16:08.650 --> 16:10.150
<b>Are you just gonna...</b>

16:10.490 --> 16:12.660
<b>stay all mopey and stuff
'til the very end?</b>

16:14.320 --> 16:17.540
<b>If being betrayed by Raijuta
hurt you that badly,</b>

16:17.870 --> 16:21.500
<b>you just need to become stronger
than Raijuta and shake it all off!</b>

16:21.790 --> 16:25.420
<b>And by Raijuta, I don't mean
that Raijuta guy that Kenshin defeated!</b>

16:25.830 --> 16:30.510
<b>The real Raijuta that you dreamed of
and believed in!</b>

16:30.630 --> 16:34.510
<b>If you can't do that, you'll be nothing
more than a loser your entire life!</b>

16:36.180 --> 16:37.470
<b>Damn you!</b>

16:39.930 --> 16:42.310
<b>I quietly listen, and you
spout anything on your mind!</b>

16:42.640 --> 16:44.520
<b>Who are you calling a loser?</b>

16:44.520 --> 16:45.650
<b>Yutaro!</b>

16:45.650 --> 16:48.110
<b>I will never quit swordsmanship!</b>

16:48.520 --> 16:49.980
<b>No way I'd ever quit!</b>

16:50.190 --> 16:53.950
<b>If my right arm is no good,
I'll do it with just my left arm!</b>

16:53.950 --> 16:57.950
<b>In the first place, I can take you down
with just my left arm anyway!</b>

16:58.280 --> 17:01.830
<b>Don't be cheeky with me,
you mopey cat-eyes!</b>

17:02.040 --> 17:04.540
<b>Shut up, you twisted weirdo!</b>

17:07.380 --> 17:08.210
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

17:09.340 --> 17:10.250
<b><i>Right.</i></b>

17:11.760 --> 17:12.800
<b><i>I get it.</i></b>

17:16.260 --> 17:18.390
<b>There's no need to worry,
that there isn't.</b>

17:22.310 --> 17:24.440
<b>All right, you better not forget.</b>

17:24.440 --> 17:27.270
<b>I'm still not done
settling the score with you.</b>

17:27.560 --> 17:29.440
<b>Make sure to come back.</b>

17:29.440 --> 17:31.860
<b>I'll keep the second student seat
in Kamiya Kasshin-ryu</b>

17:31.860 --> 17:34.030
<b>open for you while I wait.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.580
<b>Those were good people.</b>

17:49.420 --> 17:54.720
<b>I'm still injured, but he swung
at full force, not holding back.</b>

17:58.260 --> 18:02.890
<b><i>Yahiko Myojin, when I come back,
the first thing I'll do is defeat you.</i></b>

18:04.980 --> 18:08.400
<b>Now, since we're all the way
out here in Shimbashi,</b>

18:08.400 --> 18:10.110
<b>let's eat some Western cuisine.</b>

18:10.360 --> 18:12.190
<b>You want me to treat you again?</b>

18:13.650 --> 18:16.860
<b>Kenshin, you look all serious.
What's wrong?</b>

18:17.990 --> 18:18.820
<b>Well...</b>

18:19.410 --> 18:22.280
<b>I was thinking about Raijuta Isurugi,
that I was.</b>

18:22.790 --> 18:24.330
<b>He was such a despicable guy.</b>

18:24.830 --> 18:29.170
<b>But the Matoi-Izuna and Tobi-Izuna,
his techniques, were amazing.</b>

18:29.670 --> 18:31.540
<b>He definitely had a talent with swords.</b>

18:32.130 --> 18:37.260
<b>But because his talent wasn't perfect,
he didn't question the essence of swords</b>

18:37.260 --> 18:40.260
<b>and simply pursued
nothing other than techniques.</b>

18:41.220 --> 18:44.720
<b>If he wasn't so adherent
to Shinko-ryu or murderous swords,</b>

18:44.970 --> 18:49.190
<b>he may have opened up a new style
of swordsmanship to the Meiji-era world.</b>

18:50.400 --> 18:53.860
<b>I hope he can realize
that it was a blessing</b>

18:53.860 --> 18:58.400
<b>that he didn't cross the line
of killing another man.</b>

19:01.070 --> 19:03.200
<b>Hey, what are you doing?</b>

19:03.200 --> 19:04.490
<b>Let's hurry up and get going!</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:12.590
<b>Mr. Maekawa of the Chuetsu-ryu once spoke
of where swordsmanship was headed to.</b>

19:13.170 --> 19:15.800
<b>Back then,
he seemed to be quite disappointed.</b>

19:17.170 --> 19:20.300
<b>But looking at Yahiko and Yutaro,</b>

19:20.890 --> 19:23.510
<b>I don't think there's much
to worry about, that there isn't.</b>

19:26.060 --> 19:28.600
<b>KAMIYA KASSHIN-RYU</b>

19:28.600 --> 19:34.060
<b>YUTARO TSUKAYAMA
(RESERVED)</b>

19:28.600 --> 19:34.060
<b>YAHIKO
MYOJIN</b>

19:28.600 --> 19:34.060
<b>STUDENTS    KAORU KAMIYA</b>

19:30.900 --> 19:31.940
<b>You're right.</b>

21:15.790 --> 21:17.460
<b>I'm gonna kill!</b>

21:17.460 --> 21:18.920
<b>I don't care who!</b>

21:18.920 --> 21:19.920
